msgid ""
"Admission allows eligible traffic to bind; it does not prove that packets "
"are currently hardware-forwarded. The switch controls FTTR bridge and WAN "
"admission, not the entire NPU or firewall offloading for other interfaces."
msgstr "准入允许符合条件的流量绑定；它并不能证明数据包当前正在硬件转发。交换机控制 FTTR 桥接和 WAN 准入，而不是其他接口的整个 NPU 或防火墙卸载。"

msgid "Admitted"
msgstr "已准入"

