msgstr "高级诊断 / 原始配置（JSON）"

msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "高级设置"

msgid "Advertise isolated management gateway (DHCP Option 3)"
msgstr "下发隔离管理网关（DHCP Option 3）"

msgid ""
"Advertises the management bridge IP as default gateway (DHCP Option 3) on "
"br-tr069 while keeping firewall forwarding rejected, so FTTR ONUs pointing "
"to arbitrary external ACS IPs (e.g. 10.x.x.x) send packets to prerouting "
"DNAT without modifying ONU settings."
msgstr ""
"在 br-tr069 管理桥下发控制器管理 IP 作为默认网关（DHCP Option 3），同时保持防火墙 forward 为 "
"REJECT，使指向外部任意 ACS IP（如 10.x.x.x）的 FTTR ONU 无需改配即可进入 prerouting DNAT 劫持。"

