msgid ""
"All listed VLANs share one management bridge and DHCP pool. Retain an "
"existing listed management VLAN; the first VLAN is the fallback."
msgstr "所有列出的 VLAN 共享同一个管理网桥和 DHCP 地址池。请保留已列出的管理 VLAN；第一个 VLAN 将作为回退默认值。"

