msgid ""
"Controls GPON downstream 1490 nm optical emission. Turning it off removes "
"the downstream optical signal and disconnects ONUs."
msgstr "控制GPON下行1490 nm光信号发射。关闭后ONU将失去下行光信号并离线。"

msgid ""
"Controls GPON downstream FEC encoding. When downstream transmission is "
"enabled, ONU-side OMCI FEC performance monitoring is also enabled."
msgstr "控制GPON下行FEC编码；下行发射开启时，同时采集ONU侧OMCI FEC性能数据。"

msgid ""
"Controls GPON downstream frame transmission. Turning it off stops ONU "
"communication without resetting the optical module."
msgstr "控制 GPON 下行帧传输。关闭后停止 ONU 通信，但不会复位光模块。"

msgid ""
"Controls optical module reset and ONU discovery. Turning it off resets the "
"module and disconnects all ONUs."
msgstr "控制光模块复位与ONU发现流程。关闭后光模块复位，所有ONU连接中断。"

msgid ""
"Controls the optical hardware owner and ONU discovery. Turning it off "
"disables GPON transmission and disconnects all ONUs; it does not reset the "
"optical module."
msgstr "控制光硬件服务与 ONU 发现流程。关闭后停止 GPON 传输并断开所有 ONU，但不会复位光模块。"

msgid "Conversion formula"
