msgid "Corrected bytes"
msgstr "已纠正字节"

msgid "Corrected code words"
msgstr "已纠正码字"

msgid ""
"Counters cover only currently bound flows and may decrease when flows "
"expire. Driver-exported zeroes are not proof of no traffic. AN7581 native "
"L2B counters are unavailable; — means unavailable, not zero."
msgstr "计数仅涵盖当前绑定流，流老化后可能下降。驱动返回零值不代表没有流量。AN7581 原生 L2B 计数不可用；— 表示不可用，并非零。"

msgid ""
"Counters describe the last completed 15-minute PM interval, not live or "
"cumulative traffic."
msgstr "计数来自最近完成的15分钟PM区间，并非实时或累计流量。"

