msgid ""
"Off by default. In pure bridge mode where the upstream router assigns LAN "
"IPv4 via DHCP, selectively redirects verified HL202 sub-gateways' upstream "
"MQTT (TCP 1883) connections to this controller's embedded broker without "
"altering NAT-mode ONUs or downstream clients."
msgstr ""
"默认关闭。在主路由 LAN 通过上游 DHCP 获取 IPv4 的纯桥接模式下，仅对已验证的 HL202 子猫定向重定向其上行 MQTT（TCP "
"1883）连接到本控制器内置 Broker，不影响 NAT 模式 ONU 或普通下挂终端。"

msgid ""
"Off by default. Intercepts configured target ACS IP/CIDR and port "
"connections on FTTR ONU bridge ports (fttrN on br-lan, excluding router "
"eth/wlan ports) or the isolated br-tr069 management VLAN, and redirects them "
"to this controller's embedded ACS. Note: hosts bridged behind the same fttrN "
"port share that L2 port; use br-tr069 management scope for per-device source "
"IP isolation."
msgstr ""
"默认关闭。在 FTTR ONU 桥接端口（br-lan 上的 fttrN，排除主路由 eth/wlan 口）或隔离的 br-tr069 管理 VLAN "
"上按配置的目标 ACS IP/CIDR 与端口劫持重定向至本控制器内置 ACS。注意：同一 fttrN 口后方桥接下挂的终端共用同一二层口；如需按设备源 "
"IP 精确隔离请使用 br-tr069 管理网作用域。"

msgid ""
"Off by default. Logs up to three RX register snapshots at 30-second "
"intervals after restart. Restart FTTR to apply changes."
msgstr "默认关闭。重启后每隔 30 秒记录一次接收寄存器快照，最多三次。修改后须重启 FTTR 才能生效。"

